<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Painel de Administrador - Bookomunity</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/admin.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="sidebar">
        <button class="sidebar-btn" onclick="">Banco de dados</button>
        <button class="sidebar-btn" onclick="">Console</button>
        <button class="sidebar-btn" onclick="">Administradores</button>
        <div class="avatar">
            <p style="color: var(--sidebar-btn-text);">Admin</p>
            <form action="/auth/logoff" method="POST" style="display: inline;">
            <button type="submit" class="logoff">Sair</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <main>
        <div class="welcome">
            <div class="welcome-text">
                <h1>Bem-vindo ao painel de administrador.</h1>
                <p>Utilize os botões na barra lateral para navegar.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="welcome-content-container">
                <h1 style="align-self: center;">Informações</h1>
                <div class="welcome-content" id="welcome-content"><p>Carregando...</p></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>



    <script src="/js/admin.js"></script>
</body>
</html>